---
// Immersive Scrolling Visual Portfolio - Minnaar-Matthews Creative House
---
<html lang="en" style="scroll-behavior: smooth;">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Visual Archive & Portfolio | Minnaar-Matthews</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #F5F2EB; color: #2C2A29; font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; }
      
      /* Scroll visual container layout */
      .scroll-section {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        position: relative;
        padding: 6rem 4rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #E3DED4;
      }
      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .scroll-section {
          flex-direction: column-reverse;
          padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
          gap: 3rem;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body style="overflow-x: hidden;">
    
    <!-- Fixed Atmospheric Background Visual -->
    <div style="position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; opacity: 0.12; background-image: url('/hero-bg.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(125%);"></div>

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header style="position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100; padding: 1.5rem 3rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(227, 222, 212, 0.8); background-color: rgba(245, 242, 235, 0.92); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);">
      <a href="/" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-size: 1.125rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">Minnaar-Matthews</a>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center;">
        <a href="/contact" style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; text-decoration: none;">Inquiries</a>
        <a href="/" style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; text-decoration: none;">&larr; Home</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Intro Banner -->
    <section style="height: 85vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; position: relative; z-index: 10; padding: 0 2rem; margin-top: 5rem;">
      <span style="font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.4em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A756D; display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Immersive Visual Narrative</span>
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29; margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;">A Deeper Perspective.</h1>
      <div style="width: 3rem; height: 1px; background-color: #C5BEB0; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;"></div>
      <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 300; color: #5C5750; letter-spacing: 0.06em; max-width: 32rem; line-height: 1.7;">Scroll down to explore curated architectural studies, cinematic framing, and spatial compositions.</p>
      <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 2rem; animation: bounce 2s infinite; color: #7A756D; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;">
        Scroll &darr;
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Interactive Scrolling Visual Sections -->
    <main style="position: relative; z-index: 10;">
      
      <!-- Section 1: Architectural Study -->
      <section class="scroll-section" style="background-color: rgba(245, 242, 235, 0.7);">
        <div style="flex: 1; padding-right: 4pr; max-width: 32rem;">
          <span style="font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A756D; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">01 / Study</span>
          <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 400; color: #2C2A29; margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Architectural Precision</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #5C5750; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Precision lighting and modern structural composition capturing high-end design lines, clean geometry, and atmospheric balance.</p>
          <div style="display: inline-block; border-bottom: 1px solid #2C2A29; padding-bottom: 2px; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29;">Spatial Series</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1.2; width: 100%; height: 420px; background-image: url('/hero-bg.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; border: 1px solid #DDD6C8; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);"></div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Editorial Portraiture -->
      <section class="scroll-section" style="background-color: rgba(238, 233, 224, 0.8);">
        <div style="flex: 1.2; width: 100%; height: 420px; background-image: url('/hero-bg.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: bottom; border: 1px solid #DDD6C8; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); order: 1;"></div>
        <div style="flex: 1; padding-left: 4rem; max-width: 32rem; order: 2;" class="content-side">
          <span style="font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A756D; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">02 / Narrative</span>
          <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 400; color: #2C2A29; margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Editorial Portraiture</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #5C5750; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Intimate storytelling through refined framing, natural tonality, and timeless contrast that evokes enduring emotional resonance.</p>
          <div style="display: inline-block; border-bottom: 1px solid #2C2A29; padding-bottom: 2px; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29;">Character Study</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Light & Texture -->
      <section class="scroll-section" style="background-color: rgba(245, 242, 235, 0.7);">
        <div style="flex: 1; padding-right: 4rem; max-width: 32rem;">
          <span style="font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7A756D; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">03 / Atmosphere</span>
          <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 400; color: #2C2A29; margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">Light &amp; Texture</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #5C5750; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Deep exploration of shadow, tactile grain, surface materials, and atmospheric interplay designed for luxury brand campaigns.</p>
          <div style="display: inline-block; border-bottom: 1px solid #2C2A29; padding-bottom: 2px; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2C2A29;">Material Study</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1.2; width: 100%; height: 420px; background-image: url('/hero-bg.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: top; border: 1px solid #DDD6C8; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);"></div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer style="position: relative; z-index: 10; padding: 2.5rem 3rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; border-top: 1px solid #E3DED4; color: #7A756D; background-color: rgba(245, 242, 235, 0.9);">
      &copy; 2026 Minnaar-Matthews Creative House. All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>